    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dear players</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please accept our apologies for any errors, this game is being developed by two people! Please do not scold us too much.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunaton: Rescue mission is an adventure platformer with Metroidvania elements, but in a cute style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses. Collect all 12 crystals of power and restore harmony on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventures and dangers will be waiting around every corner. 12 unique regions to explore, filled with secrets, puzzles, traps, battles and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts that will help you reach previously hidden places or defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build peace on the planet, disenchant the locals of the regions, and return them home. Where they can again fish, build houses, collect minerals, and live their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/c6c3945c1c07362def709f738c43d9c1.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab tools, collect resources and save the locals by restoring the planet, play mini-games. Or just wander around the island, catching fish and insects at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/322c59429312a1609b4f1563db583926.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hot deserts and green forests to hidden mines, there are plenty of corners for you to explore. Use the transport network to move between locations, transport goods, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/20f578349020b6578e373b93ab4c7ad8.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy world, each locals has their own unique role on the island, their own activities and interests. There is their own daily schedule and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lunaton: Rescue mission is an adventure platformer with Metroidvania elements, but in a cute style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses. Collect all 12 crystals of power and restore harmony on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventures and dangers will be waiting around every corner. 12 unique regions to explore, filled with secrets, puzzles, traps, battles and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts that will help you reach previously hidden places or defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build peace on the planet, disenchant the locals of the regions, and return them home. Where they can again fish, build houses, collect minerals, and live their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/c6c3945c1c07362def709f738c43d9c1.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/b03c18b1e20a131d17da8e3e191de422.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab tools, collect resources and save the locals by restoring the planet, play mini-games. Or just wander around the island, catching fish and insects at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/322c59429312a1609b4f1563db583926.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/f91883bc0cd2883d8ca3ca668f9a29a1.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From hot deserts and green forests to hidden mines, there are plenty of corners for you to explore. Use the transport network to move between locations, transport goods, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/20f578349020b6578e373b93ab4c7ad8.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.poster.avif?t=1753628795\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.webm?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826380/extras/ac8e6e8d0b4dc44e2f4685af3d82fe1f.mp4?t=1753628795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy world, each locals has their own unique role on the island, their own activities and interests. There is their own daily schedule and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
